OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand scattered showers through the
OL,7,Fevening, some of these heavy. Further
OL,8,Fmainly light showers overnight with
OL,9,Fvariable cloud and clear spells.
OL,10,FBreezy around the Moray and Buchan
OL,11,Fcoasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA few light showers in the
OL,14,Fmorning, becoming dry and bright by
OL,15,Fmidday. A band of heavy rain pushes
OL,16,Feast through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
